From: GloriousEggroll <gloriouseggroll@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] winedmo: Retry forbidden HTTP media with the legacy user agent.

Some VRChat video hosts allow the former GStreamer HTTP source but reject
FFmpeg's default Lavf user agent. The local issue #748 reproduction fails
at the initial HLS playlist request with HTTP 403, before decoding starts.
Requesting the same URL with otherwise identical request options returns
403 with Lavf/62.12.100 and 200 with a valid #EXTM3U playlist when using
GStreamer souphttpsrc. No version suffix is needed.

Keep the default user agent for the first request and retry once with the
legacy media identity only when opening HTTP(S) media returns 403. Leave
RTSP and explicit user agents unchanged. Do not retry other failures or
change the codec, seekability, or asynchronous source-opening paths.

FFmpeg leaves the input options intact and frees/clears the format context
when avformat_open_input fails, so the retry retains timeouts and reconnect
settings. Its HLS demuxer copies the successful connection's user_agent
option to child playlist, key, and media segment requests.

Issue: https://github.com/GloriousEggroll/proton-ge-custom/issues/748

diff --git a/dlls/winedmo/unix_demuxer.c b/dlls/winedmo/unix_demuxer.c
--- a/dlls/winedmo/unix_demuxer.c
+++ b/dlls/winedmo/unix_demuxer.c
@@ -896,6 +896,14 @@ NTSTATUS demuxer_create( void *arg )
         }
 
         ret = avformat_open_input( &demuxer->ctx, url, input_format, &options );
+        if (!rtsp && ret == AVERROR_HTTP_FORBIDDEN && !av_dict_get( options, "user_agent", NULL, 0 ))
+        {
+            WARN( "HTTP source returned 403, retrying with the legacy media user agent.\n" );
+            /* A failed open frees the context but preserves the input options.
+             * HLS also forwards this user agent to playlists and segments. */
+            if ((ret = av_dict_set( &options, "user_agent", "GStreamer souphttpsrc", 0 )) >= 0)
+                ret = avformat_open_input( &demuxer->ctx, url, input_format, &options );
+        }
         free( url );
         av_dict_free( &options );
         if (ret < 0)
